    "Labels: P = P_0 (lower left), P_1, P_2, P_3 (lower arm), P_{k-1} and P_k (on the loop, with leader line to P_k), P_{n-1}, Q = P_n (top)",
    "Arc-length caliper annotation on the main curve: two short tick bars at P_{k-1} and P_k with a double-headed curved arrow labeled Δs_k",
