    "Zoom inset at lower right: isolated blue arc from P_{k-1} (left blue dot) to P_k (right blue dot)",
    "Inset caliper: two tick bars at the arc ends with double-headed arrow labeled Δs_k",
    "Red sample dot on the inset arc labeled P*_k(x*_k, y*_k, z*_k)",
    "Grey-bordered formula box at the bottom: ΔM_k ≈ f(x*_k, y*_k, z*_k) Δs_k",
    "Readout panel (added for the demo): current n, Riemann sum Σ f(P*_k)Δs_k, and the limiting value ∫_C f ds, with the running error",
